<title>BELGIUM: EU sets reduced cane molasses import duty.</title>
<headline>EU sets reduced cane molasses import duty.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee reduced the import duty for cane molasses on Wednesday, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The duty was cut to 0.15 Ecus per 100 kg from 0.38 last week. The new rate was based on a reference price of 8.06 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 7.83 last week.</p>
<p>The duty for beet molasses remained suspended at zero based on a reference price of 12.00 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 12.08 last week.</p>
</text>
